bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0071caae4c8b473a4d9f77714a013ba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b77e09cd/uploads/origins/636c9b15-b3dc-4366-b46b-3408ebc949dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0071caae4c8b473a4d9f77714a013ba, https://si.imgix.net/b77e09cd/uploads/origins/636c9b15-b3dc-4366-b46b-3408ebc949dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=49ee94a4aac25bc7c59b07f6a559ccda 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b77e09cd/uploads/origins/636c9b15-b3dc-4366-b46b-3408ebc949dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81c47f6a942dc367ad03edc8e28a3899 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b77e09cd/uploads/origins/636c9b15-b3dc-4366-b46b-3408ebc949dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b993363ebb0479918fb44eb1c19d3d72", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b77e09cd/uploads/origins/636c9b15-b3dc-4366-b46b-3408ebc949dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b993363ebb0479918fb44eb1c19d3d72, https://si.imgix.net/b77e09cd/uploads/origins/636c9b15-b3dc-4366-b46b-3408ebc949dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b51c1f6bc8da2737e8c7cc215eb364be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b77e09cd/uploads/origins/636c9b15-b3dc-4366-b46b-3408ebc949dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3172717256745801df2c53904e37ab20 3x"}, "body": "araka老师打扰了！\n自从上次收到那张插图之后，一直很想再次委托您为我绘制一张数码宝贝相关的插图…\n＊女孩子还是像上次一样戴眼镜👓麻烦了\n\n简介：\n两位都是比较别扭倔强的性格。把彼此视作自己唯一的朋友并格外珍惜，但时常由于战斗时害对方受伤而争吵，例如“才不需要你保护” “我不想看你受伤”。\n小妖兽为寻求足以保护搭档的强大力量 堕入黑暗进化成了恶魔兽，女生因此内疚起来。后来逐渐解开心结，恶魔兽才得以进化成阿斯塔兽和别西卜兽。\n\n这次的画面可以在几个故事中进行选择：\n①恶魔兽与女生的关系有所缓和。月下，两位在高楼／古堡顶端俯视现实世界繁华的街景或数码宝贝世界。『恶魔兽的翅膀有一半罩着女生』。想看到侧脸或正脸，两人神情都比较放松。\n②战斗，被邪恶的数码兽夹击。恶魔兽和女生背靠背，女生露出3/4脸（相对来说正脸更靠近屏幕中心位置，而不是两者各自露出1/2脸）。恶魔兽的翅膀就这样在女生背后张开，宛若也成为了女生的翅膀。 两人神情紧张、或表现出对周围的敌意。\n③心结解开。受伤的恶魔兽面朝女生跪下，女生流着泪伸手抓住说“不要再勉强自己，我们一起战斗吧”。温暖的金色光芒笼罩在两人身边，恶魔兽随后进化。\n\n当然，如果老师看了背景故事之后，有什么其他好的想法也欢迎绘制！搭档数码兽可以在恶魔兽、阿斯塔兽、别西卜兽之间进行选择。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10wCidHTLbzEjlfwSv4N-9yYpL6_r6ZmU", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@araka49/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 690677, "client_id": 1377136, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b7fd577/uploads/origins/67c88217-2f98-4062-8126-c8e0fd32ae0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=217eb6fdb8f84a38a9144bf8e5f9fbb8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b7fd577/uploads/origins/67c88217-2f98-4062-8126-c8e0fd32ae0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=217eb6fdb8f84a38a9144bf8e5f9fbb8, https://si.imgix.net/8b7fd577/uploads/origins/67c88217-2f98-4062-8126-c8e0fd32ae0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=095d01f19f3061a175a25c10f7db47c4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b7fd577/uploads/origins/67c88217-2f98-4062-8126-c8e0fd32ae0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=085abec6848130755e84dff3af1495bb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b7fd577/uploads/origins/67c88217-2f98-4062-8126-c8e0fd32ae0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ee98df7380b1cf28b0b10cc9018fd99", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b7fd577/uploads/origins/67c88217-2f98-4062-8126-c8e0fd32ae0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ee98df7380b1cf28b0b10cc9018fd99, https://si.imgix.net/8b7fd577/uploads/origins/67c88217-2f98-4062-8126-c8e0fd32ae0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2